        "gg5R56gVLHT_text": "<p>Here's what's actually controlling your finish.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Getting hard and finishing run on opposite systems.</strong> Getting hard needs your body in \"rest\" mode, where muscles relax and blood flows in. Finishing is triggered by your \"fight or flight\" system. The more wound up you are, the faster that system fires.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Sprays numb the skin, not the system.</strong> They dull the nerve endings, so you feel less, and so does she. But the system that triggers your finish is still running at full speed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Mental tricks pull you out of the moment.</strong> Thinking about baseball or running breathing drills mid-sex keeps you in your head, which is the opposite of the calm, present state you need.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>And control depends on the other two pillars.</strong> When you're worried about losing your erection, you rush. When your drive is running on empty, you just want it over with. Control falls when the other two pillars are shaky.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That's why Alpha Brew includes L-Theanine and Ashwagandha, studied for calm and stress resilience, alongside ingredients for desire and blood flow.</p><p>So that you're calm and present, because the other two pillars aren't pulling you down.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So you're not the guy sneaking off to the bathroom to spray himself numb, then lying there replaying it.</p>",
        "gg8i3zAtl5G_text": "<p><strong>Summary:</strong> You finish too fast. You go soft halfway through. Some nights you're not even in the mood. So you bought the sprays, the pills, the powders, the boosters. Nothing worked.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It's not your testosterone. It's not your age. It's not just stress. It's not in your head.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Most men think sex is one thing: it either works or it doesn't. It's actually 3 separate pillars, and each one runs on a different part of your body.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>What Are The 3 Pillars?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Pillar 1: Control.</strong> Finishing when you choose, not two minutes in. It runs on your nervous system, the same system that handles stress.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>When it's off:</i> You finish too fast, then lie there replaying it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Pillar 2: Erection.</strong> Getting hard and staying hard. It runs on blood flow.</p><p><br><i>When it's off:</i> It takes longer to get there, or you go soft halfway through.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Pillar 3: Desire.</strong> Actually wanting it. It runs on your brain, your hormones, and your energy.</p><p><br><i>When it's off:</i> You'd rather sleep. You stop starting things.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Here's the catch: the pillars lean on each other.</strong> Worry about going soft, and you rush to finish. Finish fast a few times, and you start avoiding sex. Avoid it long enough, and desire fades. When one pillar is off, the others follow it down.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>The flip side: when all 3 are in check, they lift each other up.</strong> Desire gets you started. A solid erection keeps you there. Control lets you finish when you choose. And one good night feeds the next: you're less anxious, so it's easier to stay hard, so you're more relaxed, so you last longer, so you actually want it again. That's what great sex really is. Not one thing working, but all three working together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That's why fixing one pillar never feels like enough. Even when it works, the other two are still holding you back.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And almost every product you've tried was built for just one pillar. Here are the 7 reasons that's why nothing worked.</p>",
        "ggAZyxIPn0b_text": "<p>Last Updated October 20 .2026</p>",
        "ggBk2pt--b7_text": "<p>Here's what the testosterone companies don't tell you.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Desire runs on more than testosterone.</strong> Wanting it also depends on brain chemistry, sleep, and how much energy you have left at the end of the day. Testosterone is one input, not the whole switch.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>More testosterone doesn't always mean more desire.</strong> Research suggests testosterone matters most for libido when it's clearly low. Once you're in the normal range, pushing it higher often doesn't bring your drive back. That's why so many men finish a bottle and feel nothing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>There's proof desire works on its own track.</strong> In clinical trials, Black Maca supported sexual desire <i>without changing testosterone levels</i>. If desire were only about testosterone, that couldn't happen.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>And boosters do nothing for the other two pillars.</strong> Even a booster that works can't help your blood flow or your control.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That's why Alpha Brew is built with Black Maca, plus Tongkat Ali and Fenugreek, to support desire on more than one front.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So that you actually want it again, instead of talking yourself into it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So you're not the guy on his third bottle of boosters, wanting to want it and feeling nothing.</p>",
        "ggDkg_ZrnPm_text": "<p><strong>&nbsp;Limited time Up To: 57% OFF + FREESHIPPING&nbsp;</strong></p>",
        "ggFxNfkqvQ__text": "4. Testosterone Supplements &nbsp;Only Chase One Hormone",
        "ggGCvqHJYJv_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Prescription_Pill_Benefits_Infographic.png",
        "ggGCvqHJYJv_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Prescription_Pill_Benefits_Infographic.png",
        "ggH0i-8S3kj_text": "<p>Here's why your blood-flow powder felt like nothing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Erections run on nitric oxide.</strong> It's the molecule that tells blood vessels to open so blood can rush in. Your body makes it from an amino acid called arginine.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>But arginine gets intercepted.</strong> When you swallow arginine, much of it is broken down by an enzyme called arginase in your gut and liver before it ever reaches your bloodstream. You're paying for a powder your body throws away.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Citrulline takes the side door.</strong> L-Citrulline isn't broken down the same way. Your body absorbs it and converts it into arginine later. Studies show it raises arginine levels in the blood more effectively than taking arginine itself.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That's why Alpha Brew uses L-Citrulline instead of arginine, plus cacao flavanols, studied for supporting healthy blood vessel function.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So that you get hard and stay hard, without chalky powders that do nothing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So you're not the guy with a cabinet full of tubs who still goes soft halfway through.</p>",
        "ggO5LpaV36L_text": "<p>Here's what most men don't know about that blood test.</p><p><strong>\"Normal\" is a huge range.</strong> Many labs treat roughly 300 to 1,000 as normal for total testosterone. A man near the bottom and a man near the top both hear the same word: \"normal.\" Your number can be more than three times lower than another man's, and you'll still be sent home.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>It usually measures total testosterone, not what your body can actually use.</strong> Much of your testosterone is bound up by a protein called SHBG, which isn't available for your body to use. The standard test often doesn't show how much is actually free.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>It's one snapshot.</strong> Testosterone rises and falls throughout the day, so a single blood draw captures one moment, not how you feel day to day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>And most importantly, it only checks one pillar.</strong> A testosterone test looks at part of desire. It says nothing about your blood flow, which drives your erection, or your nervous system, which drives your control. So \"normal\" really means \"your testosterone isn't low enough to treat.\" It doesn't mean all 3 pillars are working.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That's why Alpha Brew is built to support all three, not just one number on a lab sheet.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So that how you feel finally matches what your labs say.</p><p>So you're not the guy walking out of the doctor's office with \"you're fine,\" feeling 59 instead of 39.</p>",
        "ggOq2JaB_7U_text": "5. \"Normal\" labs sent you home with nothing",
        "gg_wnq9l89h_text": "<strong>By DR. Andrew M.</strong>",
        "gge-6aLTjb5_text": "1. Numbing Sprays Numb Your Skin, Not What Makes You Finish Fast",
        "ggh66VPTdFf_text": "7 Reasons Why &nbsp;Everything You Tried For The Bedroom Didn't Work.",
        "ggmhjQvCYG3_text": "<p>Here's how those erection pills actually work.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>They help blood flow in, but only once you're already aroused.&nbsp;</strong> Erection pills block an enzyme that shuts erections down, which helps blood stay in. But they need arousal to already be there. They don't create desire. If you're not in the mood, the pill has nothing to work with.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>They aren't designed for control.</strong> When you finish is run by your nervous system, not your blood flow. That's why a man can get hard on a pill and still finish in two minutes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>They turn sex into a schedule.</strong> Take it, wait, plan the night around it. The spontaneity you're trying to get back disappears.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>And the gas-station versions are a gamble.</strong> The FDA has repeatedly warned that some \"enhancement\" pills contain hidden drug ingredients that aren't on the label.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That's why Alpha Brew is built as a daily foundation for all 3 pillars, not a pill you time around one night.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So that getting hard isn't the only thing that shows up.</p><p>So you're not the guy timing a pill an hour ahead, then finishing in two minutes anyway.</p>",
        "ggnbMNbiLR7_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/doctor_headshot.jpg",
        "ggp7THAOKbz_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/L-Arginine_Breakdown_Infographic.png",
        "ggp7THAOKbz_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/L-Arginine_Breakdown_Infographic.png",
        "ggszcTytOYQ_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Supplement_Comparison_Chart__Hormones_Flow_Control.png",
        "ggszcTytOYQ_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Supplement_Comparison_Chart__Hormones_Flow_Control.png",
        "ggx51cRAytz_text": "2.Prescription Erection Pills Only<br>&nbsp;Works On Getting You Hard&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;",
        "ggxroFwWAI2_text": "3. Blood Flow Supplements Like L-Arginine Break Down Before They Ever Work",
        "section_preload": "true"
      },
