        "ggEIuZ706Xz_text": "<p>&nbsp;Here's what was missing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Every fix was built for one pillar.</strong> Boosters for desire. Pills and powders for erections. Sprays and programs for control.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Most were built for one night.</strong> Pills, sprays, and tricks work in the moment and wear off. Nothing was supporting your body the other 23 hours of the day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Real support takes consistency.</strong> Most of the research behind Alpha Brew's ingredients ran 4 to 12 weeks of daily use. That's a daily habit, not a one-night fix.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That's why we built Alpha Brew: real coffee with ingredients for each pillar. Black Maca, Tongkat Ali, and Fenugreek for desire. L-Citrulline and cacao for blood flow. L-Theanine and Ashwagandha for calm. All in the cup you already drink every morning. Give it 8 weeks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So that all 3 pillars hold each other up, instead of dragging each other down.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So you're not the guy juggling a booster, a pill, a powder, and a spray, and still feeling like something's missing.</p>",
        "ggGdD8B5Hz0_text": "<p>Here's why every fix felt like it almost worked.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Sex happens in a sequence.</strong> Sex researchers have described it this way since the 1970s: desire comes first, then arousal, then climax. Each phase depends on the one before it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>The pillars pull on each other.</strong> Research shows erection problems and finishing too early often show up together, and anxiety is a common bridge between them. Lose your erection once, and next time you're anxious, so you finish faster. Finish fast a few times, and you start avoiding sex, so desire fades.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>So fixing one pillar never holds.</strong> Prop one up, and the other two drag it right back down. That's not a failure on your part. It's what happens when you fix a third of the problem.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So that you finally understand why nothing ever stuck.</p><p>So you're not the guy blaming himself for problems no single product was ever built to solve.</p>",
        "ggHT_FQLiKU_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Collapsing_Pillars_Unsteady_Love.png",
